ks A1 +V to A2 -V.\nNever connect BUS_MID to PE.\nDiode K to own +V, A to own -V." (at 292.1 68.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid e7398277-93ec-48bc-ac62-48b0d6c7cf5a)) (text "Module OVP: 57.6..67.2 V each.\nThreshold sum upper: 134.4 V.\nThis is NOT a transient clamp.\nBUS_OVP, disconnect, inrush and\nall-module fault logic missing." (at 284.48 167.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 1dbccb61-6c54-4d80-be68-c39e02a41665)) (text "AC wiring, fuses, switch, protective earth and busbars require final rated parts.\nNo full-load, isolation, thermal or fault test has been performed.\nThe power prototype procedural input maximum 120 V is NOT guaranteed by module OVP." (at 15.24 213.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 068bd4f5-2039-4524-b211-ba87be01058c)) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))) (embedded_fonts no))
